  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Words of length<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math> are formed using the letters A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H, I, J. Let <math><mi>x</mi></math> be the number of such words where no letter is repeated; and let <math><mi>y</mi></math> be the number of such words where exactly one letter is repeated twice and no other letter is repeated. The, <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo></math>number of ways in which<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math> letter word can be formed using the given ten distinct letters.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></math></p><p><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;number of ways, in which<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math> letter words&nbsp;can be formed, in which exactly&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> letter is repeated twice and remaining&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math> letters are distinct.</p><p><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#160;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#160;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo> </mrow> </math></p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>",
